    "174": {"question_text": "The value of (0.125 + 0.027) ÷ (0.5 × 0.5 + 0.09 − 0.15) is (S.S.C., 2010)", "solution_steps": ["Write 0.125 = 0.5³, 0.027 = 0.3³, 0.09 = 0.3², and 0.15 = 0.5 × 0.3.", "The expression becomes (a³ + b³) ÷ (a² − ab + b²) = a + b.", "Therefore, the value is 0.5 + 0.3 = 0.8."], "question_review": "codex-vision-page-91", "solution_review": "codex-vision-page-101", "solution_pages": [101]},
